{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日向坂46 五期生の佐藤優羽です│ ˙ᵕ˙ )꜆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まずは、私のブログを開いてくださり\nありがとうございます( .ˬ. )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お会いできて嬉しいです( ¨̮ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⟡.· ┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "18th Single「イチャイチャ虫」に\n収録される五期生楽曲\n「それでもいつか」の\nストリーミングが開始、\nMUSIC VIDEOが公開されました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう既にご覧くださったみなさま、\nありがとうございます…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回センターを務めてくれるのは\n下田衣珠季です🏓"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いずきの表情から始まるMV、\nとっても印象的だなと思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ五期生の表情にたくさん注目して\nMVをご覧くださったら嬉しいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobcydF6k.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前髪をまっすぐにしてみました( ˙˙)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobAeLw9g.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お衣装、ふかふかです☁️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobEutNns.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📷⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobM0bHDg.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回初めてシンメになったにぃなさん🩰"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずっと赤ちゃんで可愛かったです、\nたくさんよしよししたよ、ふふん。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobQmpLsV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんとね、これまでの五期生楽曲全5曲中\n3曲は大野さんと同じ歌割りなのです🦀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大野さんの歌声とっても綺麗だから、\n私ももっと成長できるように頑張ります…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "（家族写真みたい📷）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MV撮影では、\n埼玉県立伊奈学園総合高等学校吹奏楽部の\nみなさまに生演奏をしていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こういった形で撮影をするのは\n初めてのことだったので、\n壮大な音楽にとても感動しました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "素敵な演奏をしてくださったみなさまと\n一緒に作品を作ることができて\nとても嬉しいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にありがとうございました( .ˬ.)\""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この楽曲は歌詞から直接受け取れるものが\n多いなと思っています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だからこそ、表現により力を入れて\nパフォーマンスしたいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だんだんと色づく世界に\n一緒に飛び込んでください。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "五期生がお見せする新たな世界を\nみなさまに沢山見ていただけると\n嬉しいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「それでもいつか」、\nぜひお聴きくださいね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いいたします。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "⟡.· ┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈⟡.·"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここまでお付き合いくださり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最新のスケジュールなどは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "公式サイトよりご確認ください( .ˬ.)\""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日向坂46公式サイト"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おやすみなさい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いい夢を(՞- -՞)ᶻᶻᶻ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#satoyublog\n/116"}], "source": "official"}